{"video": "ocda-011-reinhold-video.mp4", "duration": 446.194649, "chunk_seconds": 20.0, "stride_seconds": 15.0, "with_audio": false, "with_video": false, "claims": [{"claim_id": "cl-001", "claim_text": "Deputy Israel observed the subject traveling northbound on the sidewalk. Deputy Israel recognized the subject from a prior trespassing contact the previous night."}, {"claim_id": "cl-002", "claim_text": "Because the subject had been aggressive during the previous encounter and had made threatening statements toward deputies, we decided to make contact to check on his welfare and offer services."}, {"claim_id": "cl-003", "claim_text": "Deputy Israel exited the vehicle first and told the subject to stop."}, {"claim_id": "cl-004", "claim_text": "Deputy Israel took the lead in attempting to contact the subject while I acted as backup."}, {"claim_id": "cl-005", "claim_text": "At no point did either deputy raise their voice, use profanity, or attempt to escalate the situation."}, {"claim_id": "cl-006", "claim_text": "The subject slapped Deputy Israel's hand and arm three additional times during a period of approximately one minute and thirty seconds."}, {"claim_id": "cl-007", "claim_text": "Because the subject had become physically assaultive, we increased our use of force to gain compliance."}, {"claim_id": "cl-008", "claim_text": "After traveling approximately 300 yards, we were able to direct the subject back to the westbound sidewalk on El Camino Real."}, {"claim_id": "cl-009", "claim_text": "I then grabbed the subject by his backpack and took him to the ground."}, {"claim_id": "cl-010", "claim_text": "Because the subject had been continuously resisting and had physically struck Deputy Israel multiple times, I believed he posed a significant threat."}, {"claim_id": "cl-011", "claim_text": "Because the subject had already assaulted Deputy Israel and was now attempting to disarm him, and because I feared the subject would use the gun against us, I fired one round."}, {"c